  "faq5Title": "How do I change the card size or layout?",
  "@faq5Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq5Desc": "Open the Catalog or Collection tab, tap the 'Layout' icon (view_quilt) in the top right, then choose Grid or List, select a card size (Small/Medium/Large), or slide 'Items per row' (2-6). Changes apply instantly.",
  "@faq5Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq6Title": "How do I add a custom colored label?",
  "@faq6Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq6Desc": "Go to Others → Manage Labels. Tap the + button, enter a name, choose a color from the palette, and save. When adding or editing a collection, you can assign this label. The color will appear in your collection cards.",
  "@faq6Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq7Title": "What is the Random Pick (shuffle) button?",
  "@faq7Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq7Desc": "In the Catalog tab, tap the shuffle icon in the top bar. It randomly opens the detail page of one of the currently loaded titles. Useful when you're indecisive about what to watch or read.",
  "@faq7Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq8Title": "How do I backup or restore my collection?",
  "@faq8Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq8Desc": "Go to Others → Settings → Backup & Restore. Tap 'Export' to save your collection as a JSON file (share to Drive/Files). Tap 'Import' to restore from a file. You can choose to Merge (add new titles) or Replace All (delete current and replace).",
  "@faq8Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq9Title": "Why do my changes fail when offline?",
  "@faq9Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq9Desc": "When offline, the app displays cached data to prevent sync conflicts. Add, Edit, and Delete operations require an internet connection to Supabase. When your connection returns, tap 'Retry Connection' on the yellow offline banner to sync.",
  "@faq9Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq10Title": "What is Debug Info and how do I use it?",
  "@faq10Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq10Desc": "Go to Others → Debug Info. This page shows app version, connection status (Supabase & AniList), active settings, and the last error. Tap the copy icon in the top right to copy all info — useful for reporting bugs to the developer.",
  "@faq10Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq11Title": "How do I enable NSFW (18+) content?",
  "@faq11Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq11Desc": "Go to Others → Settings → toggle 'NSFW Content (18+)'. You must confirm you are 18+ before enabling. When enabled, the catalog will show 18+ titles with a red '18+' badge. This setting only affects the Catalog, not your collection.",
  "@faq11Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq12Title": "How do I filter the catalog by genre, year, or status?",
  "@faq12Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq12Desc": "In the Catalog tab, tap the filter icon in the top bar to open the filter sheet. You can filter by genre, tag, year, status, minimum score, and sort order. From any detail page, you can tap the year/status/genre chips to jump directly to a filtered catalog.",
  "@faq12Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq13Title": "How do I use bulk actions (delete, label, status)?",
  "@faq13Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq13Desc": "In the Collection tab, tap the checklist icon in the top bar (or long-press an item) to enter selection mode. Select multiple items, then use the bottom bar to Delete, Change Label, or Change Status in bulk.",
  "@faq13Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq14Title": "How do I mark an item as Favorite?",
  "@faq14Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq14Desc": "Open a collection detail page, then tap the heart icon in the top right. Favorites appear in Profile → My Favorites, where you can filter by Anime or Comic.",
  "@faq14Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq15Title": "What do the progress validation rules do?",
  "@faq15Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq15Desc": "Progress cannot be negative and cannot exceed the total episode/chapter count. If you set status to 'Completed', the app will offer to auto-fill progress to the total. If progress reaches the total, the status will auto-update to 'Completed'.",
  "@faq15Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq16Title": "How do I change the app theme or language?",
  "@faq16Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq16Desc": "Go to Others → Settings. Under 'App Theme', choose Dark, Light, or Follow System. Under 'Language', choose Indonesian or English. Changes apply instantly across the entire app.",
  "@faq16Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },

  "faq17Title": "What do the album cover icons mean?",
  "@faq17Title": { "description": "FAQ title" },
  "faq17Desc": "The colored dot on each media card indicates the media type: Blue for Anime, Red for Manga, Gold for Manhwa, Purple for Manhua. A red '18+' badge means the title contains adult content.",
  "@faq17Desc": { "description": "FAQ description" },
